 "chapter": "4",
 "title": "缓变包络近似",
 "short": "缓变包络",
 "lead": "描述光如何在原子介质中传播：<span data-concept=\"wave-equation-with-polarization\">波动方程</span>，以原子的<span data-concept=\"macroscopic-polarization\">极化</span>为其源，以及<span data-concept=\"slowly-varying-envelope-approximation\">缓变包络近似</span>，它把场和极化强度写成载波上的包络，并给出包络的传播方程，针对单一载波，也针对<span data-concept=\"optical-frequency-comb\">光频梳</span>的谐波。",
